        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。苏晴今天状态有点亢奋啊，怎么了？",
      "start": 8.371,
      "duration": 5.442,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，昨天半夜刷到一条科技圈的消息，到现在都没缓过来，今天必须跟你好好唠唠。",
      "start": 14.31,
      "duration": 6.356,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "得，那咱们今天肯定不愁话题了。来吧，先说让你\"没缓过来\"的那条。",
      "start": 21.119,
      "duration": 6.618,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "就是Demis Hassabis，AlphaGo之父，DeepMind现任掌门人——有消息说他可能要\"让位\"了。X上已经传得沸沸扬扬，各种版本都有，但核心信息基本一致。",
      "start": 28.142,
      "duration": 15.17,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个信号的份量不在于\"谁当老大\"，而在于Hassabis这个人代表什么。他就是DeepMind科学精神的化身，是把\"AGI\"当信仰来推的那种人。从伦敦那个研究小作坊一路带到现在谷歌体系内最前沿的AI实验室，他身上的符号意义远大于管理意义。",
      "start": 43.745,
      "duration": 24.332,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，所以\"让位\"这事儿才特别耐人寻味嘛。",
      "start": 68.542,
      "duration": 5.747,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且更有意思的是，传闻接盘的人里居然有Yann LeCun的影子。你想想LeCun是谁——Meta的首席AI科学家，一辈子都在推世界模型、自我监督学习那条路，跟Hassabis那种\"强化学习+大模型逼近AGI\"的路线其实是有些分歧的。",
      "start": 74.751,
      "duration": 19.698,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "也就是说，组织路线可能要往\"更工程化、更落地\"的方向转？",
      "start": 94.9,
      "duration": 5.834,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，2026年的AI竞争早就不只是\"谁的模型在benchmark上刷得高\"了，是\"谁能把Agent、多模态、工具调用整套串起来跑通业务\"。Hassabis适合带科学突破，LeCun风格的人更擅长把东西做出来投放到市场。",
      "start": 101.234,
      "duration": 19.785,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我听明白了——不是Hassabis不行了，是游戏规则变了，得换一种队长上场。",
      "start": 121.457,
      "duration": 6.052,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就是这个新闻的真正含义：这不是简单的人事更替，是顶级AI实验室在新一轮多模态和Agent浪潮里主动\"换挡\"。",
